WEBVTT

NOTE English captions for https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ja7eQxc9BR8, from YouTube, repeats removed.

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:03.970
If knowledge doesn't soften you, then what is it doing for you?

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:10.547
Some people think knowledge automatically makes you better, but the Qur'an shows that knowledge can also

00:00:10.547 --> 00:00:14.098
inflate the ego and ruin a person depending on who they are.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:18.472
Allah subhanahu wa ta'ala gives us a story of Qarun, a man with wealth, influence and

00:00:18.472 --> 00:00:21.080
knowledge and yet it became his downfall.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.280
He was wealthier than any wealthy person you can imagine in the world today.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:30.483
قَالَ إِنَّمَا أُوْتِيْتُهُ عَلَىٰ عِلْمٍ عِنْدِي He said, I was given all of this because of

00:00:30.483 --> 00:00:31.885
knowledge that I have.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.820
Meaning, I did this.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.020
My intellect. Look at that sentence.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:42.420
No gratitude, no humility, no recognition that Allah is the source of provisions.

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:45.087
That's how some leaders get corrupted.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:51.087
They started believing that their gifts or privileges are proof of them being superior to others.

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.627
And here's a Qur'anic leadership principle.

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:56.408
Knowledge must produce humility.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.783
Otherwise, a person may become prideful.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:03.414
Leadership thinkers and experts will say something similar.

00:01:03.599 --> 00:01:06.865
Competence without character can become a leadership hazard.

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:09.692
People don't follow knowledge alone.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:11.333
They follow trust.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.020
They follow sincerity.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:19.120
They follow ethics and principles and the Prophet ﷺ taught us to ask for beneficial knowledge

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:23.776
and also to fear, to ask for protection against knowledge that doesn't help us.

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:27.036
قَالَ اللَّهُ مَا إِنِّي أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ عِلْمٍ لَا يَنْفَعُ Allah says, I seek refuge with

00:01:27.036 --> 00:01:28.605
you from knowledge that does not benefit us.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:32.404
And of course asking for قَالَ اللَّهُ مِنْ يَسْأَلُكَ عِلْمًا نَافِعًا Allah says, I seek refuge

00:01:32.404 --> 00:01:33.573
with you from knowledge that does not benefit us.

00:01:33.573 --> 00:01:35.025
I want beneficial knowledge of Allah.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.566
Because the goal is not just information.

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:39.220
The goal is transformation.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:41.918
And we see this in the world sometimes today.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:43.140
People know a lot.

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:44.200
They may quote a lot.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.700
They may speak confidently.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:50.688
But they might be very arrogant and harsh and dismissive and obsessed with being right.

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:52.417
And the Qur'an is warning you.

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:56.230
If knowledge doesn't soften you, then what is it doing for you?

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:02.314
One day knowledge will not impress Allah ﷻ by itself.

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:05.280
It will either be a proof for you or against you.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:08.680
حُجَّةٌ لَكَ أَوْ عَلَيْكَ Hujjatun laka aw alayk So take two actions today.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.130
Before you correct someone, ask yourself.

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:14.620
Am I trying to guide someone to something better or am I trying to win?

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:17.720
And make a du'a today and every single day.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:23.915
Oh Allah, grant me beneficial knowledge and protect me from harmful knowledge, useless information.

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:27.660
Remember that knowledge that doesn't humble you can also harm you.

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:31.335
And that the sign of guidance is a softer heart and nearness to Allah.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:32.700
Leave a comment below.

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:37.312
What are some of the things that help people to focus on beneficial information and knowledge

00:02:37.312 --> 00:02:41.360
and how to put it into practice with humility and not arrogance?

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:45.160
And of course if this has benefited you in any way then share it with others

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.740
in order to remind them as well.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:47.808
May Allah bless you all.
